
extends layout.pug

block content

  article.portfolio-about
    .inner-wrapper.flex-row-wrap.two-col

      .about-intro-box.box
        h1 About Me

        h2 Software Development, Data & Cloud

        p
          | I'm Christian, a software developer interested in
          | building practical applications, exploring data,
          | and solving real-world problems through technology.

        .about-bio
          p
            | My experience includes developing web applications,
            | working with APIs and databases, and building
            | machine learning projects using Python and scikit-learn.

          p
            | Recently, I developed AeroLab AI, an interactive
            | aerospace machine learning platform using Angular,
            | FastAPI, Docker, and Microsoft Azure. The project
            | combines predictive modeling, data visualization,
            | REST API development, and cloud deployment.

          p
            | I also enjoy data analytics and visualization,
            | and I'm continuing to develop my skills in Tableau,
            | cloud infrastructure, networking, and geospatial tools.

          p
            | I value clean code, continuous learning,
            | collaboration, and creating solutions that are
            | useful beyond the classroom.


